# The React build output (`web/frontend/npm run build`) is emitted here
# locally and copied into this directory in the Docker image-build stage
# (see Dockerfile: `COPY --from=fe /fe/dist /app/web/backend/app/static`).
# Nothing in this directory is committed except `.gitignore` and `.gitkeep`,
# which exist so the directory is reachable on a fresh checkout.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
